        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX5f8XnmtNDPHPlAR7WrOe9_O3mWpVd4oQbe2mACs8-66fyTMU=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 2,
        "relative_time_description": "8 months ago",
        "text": "We took our lawn mower for revision and repair 6 days ago and they still haven’t even looked at it. They knew we needed it soon because our grass is growing  too much and they never said they would take so long. When I called today, they just said they hadn’t looked at what’s wrong and that maybe for the beginning of next week. I am very disappointed.",
        "time": 1748638365,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Naiem s.",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106771154293455016726/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXJniINt-KqMMcoLXufjrAlj3AROBBjn5IWJA18Opc1-1mTB_F8og=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 3,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Communication was difficult. I described what I want to fix, but they fixed other problems instead. Overpriced for what you get. If you have an old engine requiring repairs, my advice is get a new one and save yourself the headaches.",
        "time": 1681137027,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Joseph",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114867909035295731536/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW_IsVp-B6TsMtZfnG0nlNFjsmUPv03nYsBHZFI4cgeNJ8EWrc=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 years ago",
        "text": "It’s a pure pleasure to deal with Joe, he has everything and if he doesn’t have it, he will find it.\nI could spend all day just looking around his shop.  I have seen lots of mom and pops shops, this shop is something else. Great job Joe keep it up.",
        "time": 1610237964,
